<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ricerca Contatti</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 600px;
        }
        h2 { color: #333; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        
        /* Stile per l'Iframe */
        .iframe-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            width: 100%;
            padding-top: 56.25%; /* Rapporto 16:9 */
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        iframe {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            right: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h2>Trova Contatto</h2>
    <p>Inserisci il nome qui sotto per vedere il numero:</p>
    
    <div class="iframe-wrapper">
        <iframe src="https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxvz5mt2NXIitglBs07w7tK0zCnr3QLtLTh5304jHn-nG_v7HRU6LqexlfzA5oWJAbs/exec"></iframe>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
